{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.360000610351562,"text":"Dear colleagues, I'm Elena Orlova, the General Director of Meridian. This year, teams from London and Dubai joined us. I want everyone to hear me in their own language. Dear colleagues, welcome to Meridian. London, Dubai, Moscow. We work in different cities, but we share one goal – to make our clients' lives easier. Thank you for being part of it. We are one team, wherever you are. Bye-bye!","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"end":4.039999961853027,"text":" Dear colleagues, I'm Elena Orlova, the General Director of Meridian.","tokens":[50364,14383,7734,11,286,478,39603,1610,752,2757,11,264,6996,7680,295,6124,34681,13,50579],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3563525080680847,"compression_ratio":1.5076335668563843,"no_speech_prob":0.07527641952037811},{"id":1,"seek":0,"start":4.900000095367432,"end":8.579999923706055,"text":" This year, teams from London and Dubai joined us.","tokens":[50604,639,1064,11,5491,490,7042,293,29100,6869,505,13,50804],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3563525080680847,"compression_ratio":1.5076335668563843,"no_speech_prob":0.07527641952037811},{"id":2,"seek":0,"start":8.880000114440918,"end":12.899999618530273,"text":" I want everyone to hear me in their own language.","tokens":[50819,286,528,1518,281,1568,385,294,641,1065,2856,13,50994],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3563525080680847,"compression_ratio":1.5076335668563843,"no_speech_prob":0.07527641952037811},{"id":3,"seek":0,"start":13.359999656677246,"end":15.359999656677246,"text":" Dear colleagues, welcome to Meridian.","tokens":[51024,14383,7734,11,2928,281,6124,34681,13,51144],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3563525080680847,"compression_ratio":1.5076335668563843,"no_speech_prob":0.07527641952037811},{"id":4,"seek":0,"start":16.280000686645508,"end":17.459999084472656,"text":" London, Dubai, Moscow.","tokens":[51154,7042,11,29100,11,18298,13,51244],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.356352